what you're feeling,

400
00:27:01,883 --> 00:27:05,586
I'm sure sometimes,
your heart is asking for an ally.

401
00:27:05,586 --> 00:27:08,289
It's not a weakness to ask for help.

402
00:27:08,289 --> 00:27:10,324
<i>Sometimes, that's the way things are.</i>

403
00:27:10,324 --> 00:27:13,194
<i>We need others so we can bounce back.</i>

404
00:27:13,194 --> 00:27:17,131
Sometimes, be true to what you're feeling.

405
00:27:17,131 --> 00:27:19,933
Don't be scared to show it to others.

406
00:27:22,537 --> 00:27:26,240
He talks as if he's someone high and mighty.

407
00:27:45,793 --> 00:27:47,559
Do you need anything?

408
00:27:47,559 --> 00:27:49,567
Yes, there's something I need.

409
00:27:49,567 --> 00:27:51,732
You said that we should be true to ourselves.

410
00:27:51,732 --> 00:27:53,903
Well, then I'll be true too.

411
00:27:53,903 --> 00:27:56,603
You're so thick-faced.

412
00:27:59,373 --> 00:28:02,681
It's not bad to ask for help from others,

413
00:28:02,681 --> 00:28:05,740
and it's not good
that you always keep everything to yourself.

414
00:28:05,740 --> 00:28:09,083
Don't talk as if
you're not having a hard time,

415
00:28:09,083 --> 00:28:12,587
or act as if you're not hurting.

416
00:28:12,587 --> 00:28:15,122
Because no matter how you hide
what you're feeling,

417
00:28:15,122 --> 00:28:20,094
I'm sure sometimes,
your heart is asking for an ally.

418
00:28:20,094 --> 00:28:23,130
It's not a weakness to ask for help.

419
00:28:23,130 --> 00:28:26,100
Sometimes, that's the way things are.

420
00:28:26,100 --> 00:28:29,871
We need others so we can bounce back.

421
00:28:29,871 --> 00:28:33,875
Wow, you talk as if your heart is wide open.

422
00:28:33,875 --> 00:28:37,378
Do you think you're not keeping
all your problems to yourself?

423
00:28:37,378 --> 00:28:40,007
Hey, Nero Sebastian Araneta Ferell,

424
00:28:40,007 --> 00:28:41,916
you have no right to tell me that

425
00:28:41,916 --> 00:28:46,354
because you're actually doing that
to hide what you truly feel.

426
00:28:46,354 --> 00:28:49,590
See, why can't you be true now?

427
00:28:49,590 --> 00:28:51,392
Your heart is crushed to pieces, right?

428
00:28:51,392 --> 00:28:55,262
Because the woman you want
officially broke off with you.

429
00:28:57,765 --> 00:29:00,034
I was there earlier.

430
00:29:00,034 --> 00:29:02,803
It's just better if we move on.

431
00:29:03,471 --> 00:29:09,109
Sometimes I feel like
you're not the same person that I know.

432
00:29:10,545 --> 00:29:13,492
If we stay in this relationship,

433
00:29:13,492 --> 00:29:20,488
the more I'll get hurt,
and the more we'll hurt each other.

434
00:29:20,488 --> 00:29:22,290
I was also in the garden earlier.

435
00:29:22,290 --> 00:29:24,592
I heard everything
you talked about with Antonia.

436
00:29:24,592 --> 00:29:26,824
And what's bad is
you thought that everything was okay

437
00:29:26,824 --> 00:29:27,799
because you thought

438
00:29:27,799 --> 00:29:30,965
she received all your messages
using the doves.

439
00:29:30,965 --> 00:29:33,469
And what hurts the most,
I am the stupid one who thought

440
00:29:33,469 --> 00:29:36,970
that I'm the one you were
sending your sweet messages to.

441
00:29:45,313 --> 00:29:49,817
Look, I didn't mean to hear
your conversation with Antonia.

442
00:29:49,817 --> 00:29:54,188
What you're saying is true,
I was acting tough like I'm not scared.

443
00:29:54,188 --> 00:29:56,457
That's why I'm staying away
from Camille and Aira

444
00:29:56,457 --> 00:29:58,426
because I'm avoiding them from the start.

445
00:29:58,426 --> 00:30:02,768
That's why I went to the garden
because I was hiding from them.

446
00:30:02,768 --> 00:30:04,353
But when I realized

447
00:30:04,353 --> 00:30:06,607
that your conversation with Antonia
is so private and personal,

448
00:30:06,607 --> 00:30:09,070
I left already, okay?

449
00:30:09,070 --> 00:30:12,073
I'm sorry
but ever since I burned down your bat cave,

450
00:30:12,073 --> 00:30:15,710
I never intended to invade your privacy.

451
00:30:15,710 --> 00:30:17,721
That's just an accident.

452
00:30:18,428 --> 00:30:20,049
But it's a good thing that happened

453
00:30:20,049 --> 00:30:23,450
so I'd find out that the letters
from the dove weren't for me.

454
00:30:25,223 --> 00:30:29,455
I just want to make up
for all the kindness you did for me,

455
00:30:29,455 --> 00:30:32,593
and I know you made effort to cheer me up.

456
00:30:32,593 --> 00:30:35,729
So I can feel good about myself.

457
00:30:38,666 --> 00:30:40,635
Now I get it...

458
00:30:40,635 --> 00:30:43,575
when you told me that I was nice to you.

459
00:30:43,575 --> 00:30:46,256
So my pets end up with you.

460
00:30:46,256 --> 00:30:48,275
Why didn't you tell me right away?

461
00:30:50,878 --> 00:30:54,715
<i>Some people are having a hard time
showing their true feelings.</i>

462
00:30:54,715 --> 00:30:59,420
<i>That's why sometimes,
some guys resort to secret messages.</i>

463
00:30:59,420 --> 00:31:04,091
<i>And what I can advice you is...
not to confront him.</i>

464
00:31:04,091 --> 00:31:07,860
<i>Give him time and eventually,</i>

465
00:31:07,860 --> 00:31:12,733
<i>the time will come
when he will have the courage to face you</i>

466
00:31:12,733 --> 00:31:16,270
<i>and tell you what he truly feels for you.</i>

467
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:18,773
<i>And when the time is right,</i>

468
00:31:18,773 --> 00:31:23,515
<i>he'll shout out to the world
how much he loves you.</i>

469
00:31:23,515 --> 00:31:29,481
<i>But for now,
just let him secretly express his feelings</i>

470
00:31:29,481 --> 00:31:31,852
<i>through secret messages.</i>

471
00:31:34,288 --> 00:31:37,796
It's a long story, but I was thinking,

472
00:31:37,796 --> 00:31:43,160
the reason why you're sending me
your sweet secret messages is...

473
00:31:44,582 --> 00:31:49,629
that... you have secret feelings for me.

474
00:31:56,310 --> 00:31:59,185
I know... I know, I know, I know

475
00:31:59,185 --> 00:32:00,614
so you don't have to look at me that way.

476
00:32:00,614 --> 00:32:02,149
And besides, I know I'm not your type

477
00:32:02,149 --> 00:32:04,552
especially when I saw
your ex-girlfriend Antonia.

478
00:32:04,552 --> 00:32:06,020
There's a huge difference between us.

479
00:32:06,020 --> 00:32:08,656
If you compare Antonia with me,
that's heaven and earth...

480
00:32:08,656 --> 00:32:09,630
I'm the earth part...

481
00:32:09,630 --> 00:32:11,292
That's heaven and earth.
You too, you're heaven.

482
00:32:11,292 --> 00:32:12,843
Heaven, heaven, heaven.
That's you and Antonia.

483
00:32:12,843 --> 00:32:15,796
You're both heaven while I'm the earth
and you really won't fall for me.

484
00:32:15,796 --> 00:32:18,733
And besides,
how would you fall for your crude cook?

485
00:32:18,733 --> 00:32:21,527
That's impossible and I know that.

486
00:32:21,527 --> 00:32:24,171
Why would it be impossible?

487
00:32:24,171 --> 00:32:26,473
You're not difficult to like.

488
00:32:30,577 --> 00:32:32,346
But you're right.

489
00:32:32,346 --> 00:32:34,314
You're not my type.

490
00:32:37,249 --> 00:32:40,521
Anyway, thanks for your honesty, Florence.

491
00:32:40,521 --> 00:32:42,756
Let's see each other in school tomorrow.

492
00:32:44,258 --> 00:32:48,085
Thanks for listening
and for your understanding.

493
00:32:49,129 --> 00:32:50,671
Goodnight.

494
00:33:16,661 --> 00:33:19,422
He said I'm not difficult to like.

495
00:33:45,219 --> 00:33:47,754
Oh my, I'm already late!

496
00:34:21,427 --> 00:34:23,224
Why are you still here?

497
00:34:23,224 --> 00:34:24,625
You'll be late.

498
00:34:24,625 --> 00:34:26,560
No, Ms. Serafica, this won't take long.

499
00:34:26,560 --> 00:34:27,761
I'll be finished soon.

500
00:34:27,761 --> 00:34:30,531
Hey, Don Ferell and I talked already.

501
00:34:30,531 --> 00:34:32,132
You just have to focus on your school.

502
00:34:32,132 --> 00:34:33,734
I'll take care of the kitchen.

503
00:34:33,734 --> 00:34:36,100
No, Ms. Serafica, I can do this.
I'm almost done.

504
00:34:36,100 --> 00:34:37,338
I know you can do it,

505
00:34:37,338 --> 00:34:40,033
but we want to help you
to lessen the pressure on you.

506
00:34:40,033 --> 00:34:42,343
After all, you need to adjust
to your new school.

507
00:34:42,343 --> 00:34:43,677
Go!

508
00:34:45,479 --> 00:34:47,989
What are you waiting for? Go!

509
00:34:49,669 --> 00:34:50,985
Thank you, Ms. Serafica.

510
00:34:50,985 --> 00:34:52,559
Thank you.

511
00:34:59,066 --> 00:35:01,600
What's with you, Florencia?
The first day, you were sent to the office.

512
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:03,030
Now you're late.

513
00:35:03,030 --> 00:35:06,166
Good luck to your academic performance.

514
00:35:10,804 --> 00:35:11,872
Hello, Lina.

515
00:35:11,872 --> 00:35:13,207
<i>I need your help.</i>

516
00:35:13,207 --> 00:35:14,999
<i>Please see me in the AVP room.</i>

517
00:35:14,999 --> 00:35:16,543
AVP room?

518
00:35:16,543 --> 00:35:18,178
<i>Yes. Please, Florence.</i>

519
00:35:18,178 --> 00:35:20,547
<i>Please come and see me now.</i>

520
00:35:22,516 --> 00:35:25,085
Okay, I'm on my way.

521
00:35:34,295 --> 00:35:36,757
Hello, Lina, I'm here on the third floor.
Where are you?

522
00:35:36,757 --> 00:35:39,934
<i>Yes, just head inside the door, Florence.</i>

523
00:35:39,934 --> 00:35:42,491
I already saw the door. What's the problem?

524
00:35:42,491 --> 00:35:43,570
Do you have a problem?

525
00:35:43,570 --> 00:35:45,406
<i>Hurry, please.</i>

526
00:35:45,406 --> 00:35:47,746
Lina, I'm already here in the AVP room.
Where are you?

527
00:35:47,746 --> 00:35:49,110
[Audio Visual Room]

528
00:35:49,110 --> 00:35:52,178
Lina? Lina!

529
00:36:04,865 --> 00:36:06,487
Hey!

530
00:36:07,127 --> 00:36:08,262
Is there someone there?

531
00:36:08,262 --> 00:36:10,331
Open the door.

532
00:36:10,331 --> 00:36:11,498
Hello?

533
00:36:11,498 --> 00:36:12,633
Lina!

534
00:36:12,633 --> 00:36:14,568
Lina, are you there?

535
00:36:14,568 --> 00:36:17,972
Lina!

536
00:36:17,972 --> 00:36:21,141
This is so boring. There's no picture.

537
00:36:21,141 --> 00:36:22,724
Guys.

538
00:36:23,802 --> 00:36:25,679
Have you seen Florence?

539
00:36:25,679 --> 00:36:28,082
No. Maybe she has a class.

540
00:36:28,082 --> 00:36:30,751
I know she has a class right now.

541
00:36:30,751 --> 00:36:34,188
But I passed by her classroom
and she was not there.

542
00:36:34,188 --> 00:36:38,853
Yes, I haven't seen her today.

543
00:36:38,853 --> 00:36:40,761
What happened to her?

544
00:36:40,761 --> 00:36:43,689
I've been looking for her
for quite some time.

545
00:36:46,700 --> 00:36:49,413
Is there someone there? Open the door.

546
00:36:49,413 --> 00:36:51,137
Hello!

547
00:36:52,616 --> 00:36:56,500
Hey, if you're joking,
this is not a good joke.

548
00:36:56,501 --> 00:36:58,112
This is a bad joke.

549
00:36:58,112 --> 00:37:00,666
Please open the door.

550
00:37:00,667 --> 00:37:03,117
Hey, Lina!

551
00:37:03,117 --> 00:37:07,187
You're not funny if you're joking.

552
00:37:07,187 --> 00:37:09,689
Open the door.

553
00:37:14,361 --> 00:37:17,130
Hello, is there someone there?

554
00:37:20,868 --> 00:37:25,805
Hello, is there someone there?

555
00:37:33,414 --> 00:37:35,449
Hey, guys.

556
00:37:35,449 --> 00:37:37,184
Relax, it's just me.

557
00:37:37,184 --> 00:37:38,552
What do you need?

558
00:37:38,552 --> 00:37:40,616
I'm just looking for Nero.

559
00:37:40,616 --> 00:37:42,122
Have you seen him?

560
00:37:42,122 --> 00:37:43,457
Oh, Nero.

561
00:37:43,457 --> 00:37:45,291
He's just there.

562
00:37:48,062 --> 00:37:50,263
Hey, where did he go?

563
00:37:53,534 --> 00:37:54,668
Please!

564
00:37:54,668 --> 00:37:57,003
Is anyone there?

565
00:38:10,107 --> 00:38:11,518
Hello?

566
00:38:11,518 --> 00:38:15,656
Is there anyone there? I got locked inside.

567
00:38:15,656 --> 00:38:19,059
Kindly open the door.

568
00:38:19,059 --> 00:38:21,795
Why is there no signal?

569
00:38:21,795 --> 00:38:24,364
Hello!

570
00:38:24,364 --> 00:38:28,335
I'm begging you, I'll be late for my class.

571
00:38:28,335 --> 00:38:30,703
Lina!

572
00:38:33,240 --> 00:38:35,213
Congrats...

573
00:38:36,921 --> 00:38:39,379
You followed our instructions.

574
00:38:39,379 --> 00:38:42,515
Finally, you're learning.

575
00:38:52,653 --> 00:38:54,821
I'm begging you...

576
00:39:50,675 --> 00:39:52,509
Florence!

577
00:40:34,328 --> 00:40:35,964
Drink some more.

578
00:40:38,665 --> 00:40:40,633
I'm okay now.

579
00:40:44,738 --> 00:40:47,040
We have a clinic.

580
00:40:47,040 --> 00:40:49,142
Do you want me to take you there?

581
00:40:50,143 --> 00:40:52,111
I'm okay now.

582
00:40:54,248 --> 00:40:58,652
Thank you for saving me earlier.

583
00:40:58,652 --> 00:41:01,854
I thought I'd be locked there forever.

584
00:41:04,680 --> 00:41:07,394
Are you sure
they didn't do anything else to you?

585
00:41:07,394 --> 00:41:10,030
They just locked you inside the room?

586
00:41:10,030 --> 00:41:11,658
Yes.

587
00:41:11,658 --> 00:41:15,535
I just had a panic attack
because I'm scared of the dark.

588
00:41:15,535 --> 00:41:20,073
That's really my biggest phobia
and what I hate most.

589
00:41:20,974 --> 00:41:24,343
Maybe a traumatic event happened to you
when you were young.

590
00:41:25,813 --> 00:41:30,583
Maybe, or I just get scared easily.

591
00:41:34,698 --> 00:41:38,201
How did you find out where I was earlier?

592
00:41:39,910 --> 00:41:41,744
Where is she?

593
00:41:45,465 --> 00:41:48,602
If you won't tell me where she is,

594
00:41:48,602 --> 00:41:50,970
you'll have to fight with me.

595
00:41:59,791 --> 00:42:03,167
Camille and Aira won't stop bothering me.

596
00:42:03,167 --> 00:42:05,385
Do you want us to report them to the dean?

597
00:42:05,385 --> 00:42:07,387
No need.

598
00:42:07,387 --> 00:42:09,222
So you'll just let them?

599
00:42:09,222 --> 00:42:10,828
It's not that I'll just let them be.

600
00:42:10,828 --> 00:42:14,412
But I just thought Lina will be blamed

601
00:42:14,412 --> 00:42:17,810
because she's the one
who called me to go there.

602
00:42:17,810 --> 00:42:22,669
That's how Camille and Aira work
by deniability.

603
00:42:22,669 --> 00:42:26,719
I'm sure if I'll report them,
they'll just deny it and in the end,

604
00:42:26,719 --> 00:42:29,109
Lina will be reprimanded by the dean.

605
00:42:29,109 --> 00:42:32,415
She might even get suspended.

606
00:42:32,415 --> 00:42:36,450
Even though in truth,
she was just used in this situation.

607
00:42:36,450 --> 00:42:37,760
She's a victim...

608
00:42:37,760 --> 00:42:40,396
A victim of Camille and Aira, just like me.

609
00:42:45,258 --> 00:42:48,622
But still, she let them use her.

610
00:42:48,622 --> 00:42:51,902
Nero, not everyone is as brave as you.

611
00:42:51,902 --> 00:42:55,601
And not everyone can make a stand easily.

612
00:42:57,571 --> 00:43:01,541
If you'll let this slide now,
for sure, they'll just repeat it.

613
00:43:05,912 --> 00:43:09,182
Don't worry, I'll just be careful.

614
00:43:09,182 --> 00:43:11,684
Extra, extra, more.

615
00:43:13,987 --> 00:43:16,088
Just don't mind them.

616
00:43:24,197 --> 00:43:26,799
You're really a good person, Florence.

617
00:43:27,701 --> 00:43:32,138
I told you, you're not difficult to like.

618
00:43:41,848 --> 00:43:43,363
For our pilot episode,

619
00:43:43,363 --> 00:43:47,521
we'll talk about
the most important and special day

620
00:43:47,521 --> 00:43:49,756
that is unique only for Gyronella University.

621
00:43:49,756 --> 00:43:51,925
A day we like to call Agora Day.

622
00:43:51,925 --> 00:43:55,729
Today is a very important day
because we will be deciding

623
00:43:55,729 --> 00:43:58,632
who from the school committee
who will be working with me

624
00:43:58,632 --> 00:44:02,068
in organizing our exciting activities.

625
00:44:02,068 --> 00:44:04,838
All right then,
that makes Camille the head...

626
00:44:04,838 --> 00:44:06,310
I object!

627
00:44:06,310 --> 00:44:09,472
I nominate myself
to be the student representative

628
00:44:09,472 --> 00:44:12,278
of the Communication Arts department.

629
00:44:13,013 --> 00:44:15,816
For the first time
in the university's history,

630
00:44:15,816 --> 00:44:18,523
there are two nominees
to be the representative

631
00:44:18,523 --> 00:44:20,609
of the Communication Arts department.

632
00:44:20,609 --> 00:44:22,632
What do you think, Aldus?

633
00:44:22,632 --> 00:44:24,658
Who is your bet in this battle?

634
00:44:24,658 --> 00:44:28,495
You know,
in the short time that I've known you,

635
00:44:28,495 --> 00:44:31,698
your best quality is your heart.

636
00:44:31,698 --> 00:44:35,602
There are a lot of intelligent and witty people
in this world.

637
00:44:35,602 --> 00:44:38,138
But if only there are more people like you,

638
00:44:38,138 --> 00:44:39,706
this world would be so different.

639
00:44:39,706 --> 00:44:41,808
It'll be a whole lot better.

640
00:44:41,808 --> 00:44:44,437
That's why don't doubt yourself.

641
00:44:44,437 --> 00:44:48,281
Show everybody the power of your heart.
